{"version":1,"content":"<p>分析機構Newzoo的最新報告指出，《GTA6》這款大作有效扭轉了主機銷量全年低迷的頹勢。Newzoo在最新預測中表示，主機市場此前一直處於同比下滑狀態，而《GTA6》的即將發售正是市場回暖的核心動因。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586980.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.737137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"e5e75ca5341791808459e98ff37c4e450294c12b641deb51ff6e7670bf034335","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}